  "prefLabel": "Puc 2102.13 Utility employee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2102.13 “Utility employee” means an officer, director, employee, or agent of the utility who has specific knowledge of or who accesses customer information or distribution system information that could provide a competitive affiliate with an undue advantage.\n\nSource. #7884-A, eff 5-2-03, EXPIRED: 5-2-11\n\nNew. #9921, eff 5-3-11; ss by #10909, eff 8-8-15 (from Puc 2102.13); ss by #14556, eff 4-15-26, EXPIRES: 4-15-36 (formally Puc 2012.12)",
